d_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"V1XS9HMe9bzEuW4RZFycBA","review_id":"W-8nVjH00fL_ktfXu4EABw","date":"2015-07-24T21:42:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9460375905036926,"text_excerpt":"I've never written an online review for a restaurant before but we recently had such a good experience at Sukho Thai that I had to share. We went to their new Marigny location which is beautiful inside and out. The service was friendly and attentive without hovering and the food was outstanding. I have to admit I knew little about Thai food (unless Lean Cuisine counts). When we told the waitress we weren't sure what to order, she recommended six dishes for the six people in our party and we shared them all around. The soup was like nothing I've ever tasted. The scallops were to-die-for. Maybe this is a characteristic of Thai food but everything we ate, and I do mean everything, seemed to ..."},{"business_id":"V1XS9HMe9bzEuW4RZFycBA","review_id":"rWm1pJ5x64harVDRxn1Jzw","date":"2018-11-27T08:45:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9454377889633179,"text_excerpt":"Great Thai spot in NOLA! Their Thai tea is solid, and surprisingly not too sweet. My friends loved their Thai coffee as well. I came here with a large group, and everyone thought the food was wonderful -- some might say the portions are a little small, but I'd say this is good for you because, well, portion control. Prices are pretty fair and a little lower compared to other Thai places I've had. Love the ambience of this location, and the service is great. The only downside is the difficulty finding street parking in this area. I shared a few appetizers -- nothing stood out to me too much, but the crispy spring rolls were good! With so many rice, noodle, and soup options on the menu, it ..."},{"business_id":"V1XS9HMe9bzEuW4RZFycBA","review_id":"pu9nL-7cUBnHAFU3gcEV4A","date":"2018-12-23T23:30:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9428067207336426,"text_excerpt":"My family was chomping at the bit at around 10:00 this morning and we decided that Thai would do the trick. We all woke up starving and breakfast didn't fill any of us up. We checked Yelp for a Thai spot that would be open for business before we were too hangry to be out and about among the public. We found SukhoThai. We were the first customers of the day. What a cool place. It's located in the Marigny, and the decor is lovely. Our waitress came by with menus and water, and was so sweet. She helped us navigate the extensive menu and we were on our way to wiping out the hangry. We ordered chicken sate and ahi katsu to start. They arrived fairly quickly. We all enjoyed the chicken satay. T..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"V1XS9HMe9bzEuW4RZFycBA","photo_id":"Av4hUiZo9Uuz-0-tIeDgcQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Av4hUiZo9Uuz-0-tIeDgcQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8462436199188232},{"business_id":"V1XS9HMe9bzEuW4RZFycBA","photo_id":"QDX2POb7hDL6XT6K3nARoQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/QDX2POb7hDL6XT6K3nARoQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8282592296600342},{"business_id":"V1XS9HMe9bzEuW4RZFycBA","photo_id":"3nb3vUKqqE9EaODToVRcRQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/3nb3vUKqqE9EaODToVRcRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.80536001920700